<title>SOUTH AFRICA: IBCA reaffirms SAB domestic ratings.</title>
<headline>IBCA reaffirms SAB domestic ratings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>European credit rating agency IBCA said on Monday it had reaffirmed South African Breweries' domestic A1+ short-term and AA+ long-term ratings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
